========================================================================
1. Data generated with libjxl 0.12.0
========================================================================

iat-core embeds a table of 289 ICC profiles (269,112 bytes) that libjxl 0.12.0
synthesizes from JPEG XL colour encodings. The table was produced by running
libjxl itself (tools/libjxl_gen/gen_jxl_icc_table.cpp in the source repository),
so it is covered by the libjxl license:

  libjxl - https://github.com/libjxl/libjxl
  License: BSD-3-Clause
  Copyright (c) the JPEG XL Project Authors.
  Full text: licenses/libjxl-BSD-3-Clause.txt

